{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C/C++ header", "description": "This header file defines the interface and data structures for the Slap Loam Broker Object (SLAP LBO). It includes type definitions, function pointer prototypes for operations such as property management, object binding, and processing internal calls, as well as the main SLAP_LOAM_BROKER_OBJECT structure which encapsulates the object's state and behavior. The file serves as part of the SLAP environment, supporting object location, query handling, and interactions within the Service Logic Aggregation Plane.", "external_files": ["ansc_co_interface.h", "ansc_co_external_api.h", "ansc_ifo_cpc.h", "slap_properties.h"], "external_methods": [], "published": ["SLAP_LOAM_BROKER_CLASS_CONTENT", "SLAP_LOAM_BROKER_OBJECT", "ACCESS_SLAP_LOAM_BROKER_OBJECT"], "classes": [{"name": "SLAP_LOAM_BROKER_OBJECT", "description": "The main object class representing the SLAP Loam Broker, containing properties, interface handles, lock mechanisms, object binding tables, and function pointers for operations."}, {"name": "SLAP_LBO_OBJECT_BINDING", "description": "Data structure representing a binding between an object name and a party name within the SLAP environment."}, {"name": "SLAP_LBO_ASYNC_CALL_INFO", "description": "Structure holding information necessary for performing asynchronous call processing related to object location queries."}], "methods": [{"name": "GetAnscCpcIf", "description": "Retrieves the interface handle to the Cpc interface."}, {"name": "GetProperty", "description": "Retrieves the properties associated with the SLAP LBO."}, {"name": "SetProperty", "description": "Sets new property values for the SLAP LBO."}, {"name": "Reset", "description": "Resets the object properties to default values."}, {"name": "AcquireAccess", "description": "Acquires access lock for thread safety."}, {"name": "ReleaseAccess", "description": "Releases the previously acquired lock."}, {"name": "GetObjBinding", "description": "Retri